    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an unpredictable US President in this offbeat first-person simulator. Manage advisors, sign decrees with hilarious or disastrous consequences, balance national policies, handle crises, and manipulate the media \u2013 or just press the Big Red Button and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Decrees:</strong> Sign, stamp, discard or cancel laws with tangible, often surprising outcomes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.poster.avif?t=1747734476\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.webm?t=1747734476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.mp4?t=1747734476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advisor System:</strong> Build your cabinet; advisors propose decrees aligned with their expertise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Crisis Management:</strong> Handle national emergencies, triggered by policy missteps or random events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Media Manipulation:</strong> Shape public perception through interviews and press interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile First-Person Simulation:</strong> Interact directly with your presidential desk, advisors, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Strategy:</strong> Grow your popularity and wealth to unlock new powers, decree types, and gameplay options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offbeat Humor:</strong> Embrace absurdity or aim for serious leadership \u2013 the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Big Red Button:</strong> Tempt fate with chaotic, unexpected consequences at your fingertips.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an unpredictable US President in this offbeat first-person simulator. Manage advisors, sign decrees with hilarious or disastrous consequences, balance national policies, handle crises, and manipulate the media \u2013 or just press the Big Red Button and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Decrees:</strong> Sign, stamp, discard or cancel laws with tangible, often surprising outcomes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.poster.avif?t=1747734476\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.webm?t=1747734476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/a63cdaa4b8b06078edb04aaa07a106cb.mp4?t=1747734476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advisor System:</strong> Build your cabinet; advisors propose decrees aligned with their expertise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Crisis Management:</strong> Handle national emergencies, triggered by policy missteps or random events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Media Manipulation:</strong> Shape public perception through interviews and press interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile First-Person Simulation:</strong> Interact directly with your presidential desk, advisors, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Strategy:</strong> Grow your popularity and wealth to unlock new powers, decree types, and gameplay options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offbeat Humor:</strong> Embrace absurdity or aim for serious leadership \u2013 the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Big Red Button:</strong> Tempt fate with chaotic, unexpected consequences at your fingertips.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
